        <activityName xml:lang="en">Disposal, cantilever retaining wall, reinforced concrete</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Disposal, cantilever retaining wall, reinforced concrete
Modern Swiss und European technologies are applied to building machines, material production and building processes. 
UUID: 5f73c386-a896-438e-9513-0048f7bb447a
1 meter of cantiliever retaining wall, height 5.4 meters. System boundary includes deconstruction phase (C1), transport phase (C2), treatment/ recycling phase (C3), and final disposal phase (C4) for for one meter of installed cantiliever retaining wall, including excavation, backfilling and foundation works. Service life time 50 years
Location: Switzerland
Technology: According to ASTRA (2025), project specific data related to study "Anwendung der Ökobilanz-Methode für die Infrastruktur von Nationalstrassen".
Time period: Review of data currency scheduled after 5 years.
Production volume: 
Sampling: 
Extrapolations: None
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_5f73c386-a896-438e-9513-0048f7bb447a.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
